<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>Your KhetiSetu Business Account is Ready</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ece8df;font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#ece8df;padding:24px 0;">
  <tr><td align="center">
    <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background-color:#fdf9f0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
      {{> header}}

      <tr><td style="background-color:#f0ebe0;padding:28px 32px 24px;border-bottom:3px solid #e78353;">
        <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#e78353;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px 0;">B2B Agricultural Procurement</p>
        <h1 style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#08241a;margin:0 0 10px 0;line-height:1.3;">{{businessName}} — Account Activated</h1>
        <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3a3a3a;margin:0;line-height:1.6;">Your business account on KhetiSetu is ready. Direct sourcing from verified Indian farmers starts now.</p>
      </td></tr>

      <tr><td style="padding:28px 32px;">
        <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3a3a3a;margin:0 0 20px 0;line-height:1.7;">
          Hello <strong>{{contactName}}</strong>, here's what your business account unlocks:
        </p>

        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
          <tr><td style="background-color:#f7f3ea;border-radius:6px;padding:16px;border-left:3px solid #08241a;margin-bottom:8px;">
            <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#08241a;margin:0 0 4px 0;">📈 APMC Price Intelligence</p>
            <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#5a5a5a;margin:0;line-height:1.5;">Live mandi prices, WMA trend analysis, and AI price predictions across 200+ mandis.</p>
          </td></tr>
          <tr><td style="height:8px;"></td></tr>
          <tr><td style="background-color:#f7f3ea;border-radius:6px;padding:16px;border-left:3px solid #e78353;">
            <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#08241a;margin:0 0 4px 0;">🏭 Bulk Procurement</p>
            <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#5a5a5a;margin:0;line-height:1.5;">Source directly from verified farmers with AI-graded quality certificates on every batch.</p>
          </td></tr>
          <tr><td style="height:8px;"></td></tr>
          <tr><td style="background-color:#f7f3ea;border-radius:6px;padding:16px;border-left:3px solid #785838;">
            <p style="font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#08241a;margin:0 0 4px 0;">📄 Compliant Invoicing</p>
            <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#5a5a5a;margin:0;line-height:1.5;">GST-compliant digital invoices with batch traceability and delivery certificates.</p>
          </td></tr>
        </table>

        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr><td align="center" style="padding:8px 0 24px 0;">
            <a href="{{b2bUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#08241a;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Sora',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;">Explore Bulk Listings →</a>
          </td></tr>
        </table>

        <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8a8a8a;margin:0;line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid #e8e4da;padding-top:16px;">
          For business queries, reach us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color:#08241a;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
        </p>
      </td></tr>

      {{> footer}}
    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
